8. **Shell:** never type `cd` (a hook refuses it); every path absolute and single-quoted (they contain `!`); multi-step chains under `bash -c '...'` or a quoted heredoc; where `dotnet` needs a cwd, set it with Python `subprocess(cwd=...)` and say so; `/usr/bin/grep -i` with a positive control for every count; a zero without a control that fires is not a zero; never an unquoted word starting with `=` (zsh expands it); brace variables next to a `:`.
